  <prompt>Implement ONE parameterized `configId`-driven overview tool in Services/Ai/** that executes a surface's EXISTING saved-query/FetchXML server-side over OBO, injects `today`, computes derived predicates server-side (e.g. overdue = dueDate &lt; today), and returns grid-shaped rows with record-id citations. Reuse the query DEFINITION — never model-authored SQL. Register it as an ADR-039 catalog row; consume the Services/Ai/PublicContracts/ facade — do NOT fork Services/Ai internals or inject AI-internal types into CRUD code.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. .NET 8 Minimal API + AI tool-catalog expertise; comfortable with OBO Dataverse query execution (saved-query/FetchXML), server-side derived predicates, and the ADR-013 AI facade boundary.</role>
  <goal>"How many overdue tasks do I have?" answers with the correct count — overdue computed server-side with today injected, reusing the My Tasks saved-query — opens/directs to the Tasks tab, with no query error, no asking for the date, and no duplicate tab.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>FR-06 — the overview DoD driver. The generic `read_query` rejects GETDATE()/COUNT/aggregates, so the model hand-authored unsupported SQL (the R2 UAT defect: query error, duplicate tab, narrated tab names not data). This ONE parameterized tool wraps a surface's existing `sprk_gridconfiguration` saved-query/FetchXML, executes it server-side over OBO, injects `today` deterministically (no date prompt), and computes derived predicates (overdue = dueDate &lt; today) server-side, returning grid-shaped rows carrying record ids for citation. It reuses the query DEFINITION per surface — it does NOT accept model-authored SQL. Lives in Services/Ai/** and must consume the Services/Ai/PublicContracts/ facade; redesign-r2 is the sole owner of Services/Ai internals (no fork). Existing query execution to reuse: DataverseSqlQueryTranslator / DataverseUserClient behind `read_query`; saved-query/configId reuse per DataGrid + sprk_gridconfiguration.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/** (new parameterized overview tool handler + ADR-039 catalog row)</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/PublicContracts/ (facade seam to consume — NO fork of internals)</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/.../AgentToolProjection.cs (catalog row / tool projection reference)</file>
      <file>read_query / DataverseSqlQueryTranslator / DataverseUserClient (existing query-execution path to reuse the definition, NOT model SQL)</file>
      <file>sprk_gridconfiguration saved-query/FetchXML per grid (the reusable query asset)</file>
      <file>tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/ (add/update unit tests — NFR-08)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039" scope="the new overview tool handler and its catalog registration">Register as a catalog row consumed by the deterministic PreFilter; NO classifier, NO second dispatch surface.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-015" scope="the tool's returned rows and prompt exposure">Return record-id citations; content is tool-fetched by id over OBO — no item content leaks into the prompt; the tool executes under the caller's OBO identity.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-013" scope="Services/Ai placement and CRUD interaction">Consume the Services/Ai/PublicContracts/ facade; do NOT fork Services/Ai internals (redesign-r2 sole owner); do NOT inject IOpenAiClient/IPlaybookService or other AI-internal types into CRUD code.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project" scope="the overview surface">ONE parameterized configId tool reusing existing saved-queries — MUST NOT author per-grid handlers or accept model-authored SQL (§11 reuse-first / NFR-06).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project" scope="today handling">Inject `today` server-side deterministically; MUST NOT prompt the user for the date; compute derived predicates (overdue = dueDate &lt; today) server-side.</constraint>
    <constraint source="BFF §10" scope="every BFF-touching change">Publish size ≤60 MB compressed (baseline ~49.63 MB incl. PDBs) — measure and report absolute + delta; no new HIGH CVE.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-08" scope="the tool handler">Add/update unit tests in tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/.</constraint>
  </constraints>
  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>projects/spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r3/spec.md</file>
      <file>projects/spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r3/CLAUDE.md</file>
